Package: deepMatchR
Title: Deep Learning Models for HLA Matching
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Nick", family = "Borcherding", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ncborch@gmail.com")
Description: A set of tools and models for analyzing HLA matching. This includes
    the identification and quantification of immunogenicity mismatches, visualization
    of sequence alignments with mismatch highlighting, and interaction with common tools in HLA.
